    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quartermaster is an online co-op FPS with a strong emphasis on inventory management, where you must use a multitude of different weapons and traps to fight tons of dangerous robots.<br><br>Explore Neuraxis, a massive cyberpunk city, and complete objectives with up to 3 friends. <br><br>Strategize and keep only the most important items in your inventory. Don\u2019t get backed into a corner with only a Medkit in hand! <br><br>Communicate with your teammates to get through objectives. To get through this city alive, you\u2019ll need to have good teamwork. Leave no robot behind! <br><br>Watch out for the hordes of enemies chasing you. You never know what could be right around the corner\u2026</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quartermaster is an online co-op FPS with a strong emphasis on inventory management, where you must use a multitude of different weapons and traps to fight tons of dangerous robots.<br><br>Explore Neuraxis, a massive cyberpunk city, and complete objectives with up to 3 friends. <br><br>Strategize and keep only the most important items in your inventory. Don\u2019t get backed into a corner with only a Medkit in hand! <br><br>Communicate with your teammates to get through objectives. To get through this city alive, you\u2019ll need to have good teamwork. Leave no robot behind! <br><br>Watch out for the hordes of enemies chasing you. You never know what could be right around the corner\u2026</p>",
